  "body": "Designed to meet the demands of modern multi-generational living, this impressive 317sqm (approx.) residence sits proudly on a 613sqm (approx.) freehold section, offering space, adaptability and refined comfort across two thoughtfully planned levels. Generous proportions and a practical layout combine to create a home that is as functional as it is inviting. Backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this home offers quality craftsmanship and peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers outstanding flexibility, incorporating a self-contained two-bedroom granny potential complete with its own bathroom, dedicated living area, and a storage room. A heat pump ensures year-round comfort within this space, enhancing both warmth in winter and cooling in summer. Thoughtfully designed for independence and practicality, it presents an ideal solution for an extended family, teenagers seeking greater privacy, or welcoming guests in complete comfort.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, an expansive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area forms the vibrant heart of the home. Bathed in natural light, this welcoming space offers seamless flow and generous proportions suited to both relaxed family living and large-scale entertaining. A separate lounge adds valuable versatility, perfect as a media room, formal sitting area, or a peaceful retreat away from the central hub.The living area flows seamlessly onto a sunlit balcony, creating a natural indoor-outdoor connection perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or enjoying the surrounding views. \r\n\r\nThe well-considered dual-kitchen design elevates functionality for busy households and avid entertainers alike. A statement island bench anchors the main kitchen, providing abundant workspace and serving as a natural gathering point for casual meals and social occasions. Adjacent, the fully equipped second kitchen enhances efficiency and keeps the main space effortlessly organised when hosting. \r\nThe home features a generously proportioned kwila deck and garden with private screen, offering abundant space for outdoor entertaining, alfresco dining, or simply relaxing in the sun. A spa pool adds a touch of luxury, creating the perfect spot for unwinding or socialising. This versatile outdoor area truly enhances the home's lifestyle appeal, serving as a serene retreat for both leisure and entertaining.  \r\n\r\nThe first level hosts a spacious master suite, complete with a beautifully appointed ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe, offering a private sanctuary to unwind. Three further generously proportioned bedrooms are thoughtfully arranged and serviced by a contemporary family bathroom, providing comfort and practicality for the whole household. A separate guest toilet adds an extra layer of convenience, enhancing the home's functionality for daily living.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features Include:\r\n* Central air-conditioning system\r\n* Smart home system\r\n* Pre-wired EV charger\r\n* Double inter-access garage with storage space\r\n* Double Bosch ovens \r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Millwater's most desirable locations, this property provides easy access to top-rated schools, lush parks, golden beaches, boutique shopping, and convenient transport links. It's a lifestyle address designed for families who value quality, space, and connection.\r\n\r\nSpacious, flexible and filled with natural light, this is a home thoughtfully designed to grow with your family, offering comfort for today and adaptability for the future.\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing or attend the next open home.",
